{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4fe0e73f0111c76f52fa5ff21b686d62cdc319980c7c268389ca766b9cb365d6", "ja": "あずささん、お疲れ様です。\n新しい衣装、すごく似合ってますね！", "zh": "阿梓莎小姐，辛苦了。\n新衣服非常适合您呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "0032b12c369a1ae2a60323a3aff9c39a73bf6134b99b17bb84496617b857ae68", "ja": "まあ、ありがとうございます～。私に似合うかなって、\n最初はちょっと不安だったんですけど……。", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢你～。我一开始还有点担心，\n自己穿上会不会好看呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "35309ea46b0e1f729d860169894fecd536bd8e975bb502596ffda14adcb2ee1f", "ja": "そう言ってもらえて、ホッとしました～。\n衣装に合わせて、髪も……ほら♪", "zh": "听你这么说，我就放心了～。\n为了配合服装，头发也……看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c1c578d66b54162316e8037f4a0dad4f4919e98fe88a66302d6dfc064d81dbbe", "ja": "長さを変えるだけでも、イメージがガラッと\n変わりますね。髪の長いあずささんも、素敵ですよ。", "zh": "光是改变头发的长度，给人的感觉就会完全不同呢。长发的梓小姐也很漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "82df6f8c66f530a6d3729cbbf517db6d8a03587456866644b5dea678beb5dc7c", "ja": "本当ですか？　ふふっ、嬉しいです♪\nこの髪型に決まるまで、いろいろと試したんですよ。", "zh": "真的吗？呵呵，真开心♪\n为了决定这个发型，我可是尝试了各种不同的样式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "2b556b901da2dca53e9743083763e97a2adb78aac7bfaff1ed491a43f2ba802f", "ja": "髪をアップにしてみたり、毛先をクルクル巻いて\nみたり……。", "zh": "我试过把头发盘起来，或者把发梢卷得一圈一圈的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "11f50b1ff5b09c788e3eaa1f11d27e0070edb8e64539c4d895058beb7da42944", "ja": "でも今回は、ゴシックセクシーな女王様という感じ\nなので、長い髪の方が、雰囲気が合うかなと思って。", "zh": "不过这次是哥特性感的女王风格，我觉得留长发更符合这种氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b92e1c4efabfcf4ebb6f0e8b0960b36b017a84e7b86d01a42854f83ab28bbff9", "ja": "なるほど。確かに長い方が、風格が出て、女王様っぽく\n見えますね。狙い通りになっていると思いますよ。", "zh": "原来如此。确实，头发长一些更显气势，看起来也更像女王。我觉得已经达到预期效果了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "6abf74761296d714f69f5a99111aaf9c543f0cde7def2665a58cfb103662c6ca", "ja": "ふふ、よかったです♪\nただ、ちょっと気になっていることがあって……。", "zh": "呵呵，那就好♪\n不过，我有件事有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "b55f177b0dee3a1c6eba6a5a4d1d40304d617eaa24ed245436d92e78f3956e3d", "ja": "この衣装は、吸血鬼のモデルにもなった、狂気の\n伯爵夫人をイメージして作られたそうなんです。", "zh": "听说，这套服装的设计灵感，来自一位曾成为吸血鬼原型的疯狂伯爵夫人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "2dd796599efae279d95b913b10805a0d09ad922607b35cf8f2598b54fcb751a3", "ja": "なので、ちょっと怖くて悪い女性の雰囲気を出した\n方が、この衣装をもっとうまく着こなせるかなって。", "zh": "所以我觉得，展现出那种有点可怕又邪恶的女性气质，或许能更好地驾驭这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1cfc57ad18f1ce36bc47d04649830a259ee01b086a6d1f59859a10c0095383b4", "ja": "それはいいアイディアですね。悪女のあずささんは、\n今までにない、新しい魅力になる気がします。", "zh": "这是个好主意。扮演坏女人的梓小姐，感觉会展现出前所未有的新魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "a2323e0dec048205b724991e3b36213cf179311a07916fe26829ca9cd1516c5c", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、そう思いますか？\n悪女……悪女ってこんな感じでしょうか……ええと。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也这么觉得吗？\n恶女……恶女应该是这种感觉吗……呃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "dfa272b0b4b8da75bd83cf96426c5ab1740914da0cd385f1898260df52fa33e4", "ja": "「……さあ、跪きなさい。この世で一番美しいのは\nこの私よ！　アーッハハハハ！」", "zh": "“……来吧，跪下。这个世上最美的人，\n就是我！啊——哈哈哈哈！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ac94f47cc73a513300607b54b763d9ea0c6f1a2f6130ab6dd4ecfadb0ec93c42", "ja": "おお……！　いつものあずささんとは全然違って、\nゾクッとしました。悪女っぽさ、出てましたよ。", "zh": "啊……！和一贯的梓小姐完全不一样，让我不禁打了个寒颤。恶女的感觉表现得很到位哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "2fd857554b1be5c2f5421f95c6d209880fce511f834f9c104a4f912f92819bf8", "ja": "うふふ、うまくできたみたいで、よかったです～。\nでも、もう少しセクシーさが出るといいんですけど。", "zh": "呵呵，能演得好真是太好了～。\n不过，要是能再表现出一点性感就好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1016_p", "source_sha256": "050b1e11b75169bd6a44780d16ed7ee85085808991fb35dfcbdaa3b0242ab3f3", "ja": "セクシーさですか……。それじゃあ、血を見て、\nうっとりしているところとか、どうですか？", "zh": "性感吗……那就试试表现出看到血后陶醉的样子，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "00aad5d2a8d83570a6b8c27ef2af1b4067432d452b78a4bdc643bc49b27a6ac6", "ja": "まあ、それは色っぽくて、いいかもしれませんね。\nうまくできるかしら……。でも、やってみますね♪", "zh": "嗯，那样确实很性感，或许不错呢。\n不过，不知道我能不能演好……但我会试试的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "136d170ab1a77671bb7e545ea1594098bc6f21164100a6a9052cbb98ac9071c9", "ja": "「……ああ、なんて新鮮で綺麗な血なのかしら。これを\n飲めば、私はもっと美しくなれる……ウフッ♪」", "zh": "“……啊，多么新鲜又美丽的血液啊。只要喝下它，\n我就能变得更加美丽动人……呵呵♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a9c3c618d5d32969fc720851cf9671a06fa53d28f10b7149c0208bf61d8ef096", "ja": "さ、さすがです！　セクシーな吸血鬼って感じで、\nとても魅力的だと思います。", "zh": "真、真不愧是您！很有性感吸血鬼的感觉，我觉得特别有魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "dad07d85ca83ee668417bc38bc665c962073bbdb07617d43a9e0df8d3f8eee9c", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとうございます～♪\nこの調子で、続けてみますね！", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你～♪\n我会保持这个状态，继续下去的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_010azu0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_010azu0244_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "877b6581a66095e40e362e354540de3c1b6313304d8eb5bd23a91d6bf4e89cf3", "ja": "「それじゃあ、{$P$}さんの血も\nいただいちゃおうかしら？」……なんて。うふふ♪", "zh": "“那我也把{$P$}先生的血给\n吸干吧？”……开玩笑的啦。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
